WEBVTT

00:11:28.606 --> 00:11:31.121
we need every solution and every solver,

00:11:32.186 --> 00:11:33.743
every mind,

00:11:33.767 --> 00:11:35.341
every bit of heart,

00:11:35.365 --> 00:11:37.048
every set of hands.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:40.693
We often crave a simple call to action,

00:11:41.447 --> 00:11:44.650
but this challenge demands
more than a fact sheet

00:11:44.674 --> 00:11:46.350
and more than a checklist.

00:11:46.978 --> 00:11:50.128
We need to function
more like an ecosystem,

00:11:50.152 --> 00:11:52.543
finding strength in our diversity.

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:55.681
You know what your superpowers are.

00:11:56.356 --> 00:12:02.420
You're an educator, farmer, healer,
creator, campaigner, wisdom-keeper.